WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.733 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Chiaro Code presents RideReady. Clear numbers. Clear zones. A calmer pickup.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.067 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Your laptop is the controller. Put the pickup board on a TV.

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:20.533 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Enter two forty-seven. Choose Zone one, then add it. The TV updates.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:26.533 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Drag the number to Zone two. Check the destination and confirm the move.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:34.133 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Scan the pairing code on your phone. Use the same Wi-Fi and keep the laptop running.

00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:43.133 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Your phone is now a wireless controller. Add four oh eight to Zone one. The same TV updates.

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:49.533 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Chime and voice are optional. Switch them on for a chime before each spoken number.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:56.133 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Number two forty-seven. Zone two.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:01:01.000 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Choose a readable theme and show call counts in Settings.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:07.600 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Wireless control uses the same Wi-Fi. Online relay is planned.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.833 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
Close the session when pickup is finished.

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:16.133 line:14% position:50% align:center size:90%
RideReady, by Chiaro Code. Explore the product online.
